      "headline": "Modder Makes NVIDIA DLSS 5 Neural Rendering Work On GeForce RTX 40 Series Through A Simple CUDA Binaries Swap",
      "confirmed_facts": [
        {
          "fact_id": "f1",
          "text": "Uncle Burrito made an experimental patch, which got the job done, exposing the controls for tweaking the image quality in the game.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-29T08:05:50.849677+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "a70657f99f7f4575cf38b1712d1ae88214adcdca19dd75732f3be5f6d5d6d7eb",
          "excerpt": "Uncle Burrito made an experimental patch, which got the job done, exposing the controls for tweaking the image quality in the game.",
          "sentence_hash": "feb3eb293672c7c068d6fe411dc35fe8da098ee8610154463be328ecdb287cbd",
          "anchors": [
            "control"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f2",
          "text": "That said, it's important to highlight that, just like the RTX 50 series, the performance was also impacted on the RTX 4090, and the modder saw as much as a 39% performance reduction, witnessing the FPS drop from 135-145 to just 83.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-29T08:05:50.849746+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "a70657f99f7f4575cf38b1712d1ae88214adcdca19dd75732f3be5f6d5d6d7eb",
          "excerpt": "That said, it's important to highlight that, just like the RTX 50 series, the performance was also impacted on the RTX 4090, and the modder saw as much as a 39% performance reduction, witnessing the FPS drop from 135-145 to just 83.",
          "sentence_hash": "daa2ddccce8839b1cffbebb071e3cebcf8f6ca5b6f1a1c2bfc209b6a9ecc3a5e",
          "anchors": [
            "39%"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f3",
          "text": "Nonetheless, this remains an experimental feature, and we will see how it turns out in the official release.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-29T08:05:50.849775+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "a70657f99f7f4575cf38b1712d1ae88214adcdca19dd75732f3be5f6d5d6d7eb",
