      "summary": "In just 24 hours, we saw modders enabling DLSS 5 NR implementation in multiple games as well as enabling it on the RTX 40 series cards. NVIDIA DLSS 5 Neural Rendering Now Works on ADA RTX 40 GPUs Ahead of Official Release A lot of development happened in the last two days since the DLSS 5 Neural Rendering DLL file got leaked in the early-access NBA 2K27 build. We saw modders from the RenoDX community enabling the experimental implementation in Control, but later on, we saw this implementation wo",
